---
import { getCollection, render } from 'astro:content';
import about from '../content/about.md?raw';
import '../styles/global.css';

const posts = (await getCollection('posts', ({ data }) => !data.draft)).sort((a, b) => b.data.date.valueOf() - a.data.date.valueOf());
const rendered = await Promise.all(posts.map(async (post) => ({ post, ...(await render(post)) })));
const catalog = rendered.map(({ post }) => ({ id: post.id, title: post.data.title, category: post.data.category, date: post.data.date.toISOString().slice(0, 10), description: post.data.description }));
const cleanAbout = about.replace(/^# About Vect\s*/, '');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#101725" />
    <meta name="description" content="Vect 的个人博客。技术与随笔，两种阅读方式。" />
    <title>Vect — a place to think</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <canvas id="sky" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <main id="app">
      <section class="gateway" id="gateway" aria-label="选择阅读方式">
        <div class="gateway-top"><img class="avatar avatar-gateway" src="/avatar.jpg" alt="Vect 的头像" /><span class="gateway-label">A PLACE TO THINK / VECT</span><span class="gateway-index">01 / 02</span></div>
        <div class="gateway-grid">
          <button class="choice choice-terminal" data-open="terminal" aria-label="打开终端阅读模式">
            <span class="choice-number">01 &nbsp; / &nbsp; EXPLORE BY COMMAND</span>
            <span class="mini-terminal" aria-hidden="true"><span class="mini-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><em>vect@journal:~</em></span><span class="mini-line"><b>vect@journal</b>:<strong>~</strong>$ <span id="typed">&nbsp;</span><span class="cursor">▍</span></span></span>
            <span class="choice-bottom"><span><strong>Terminal</strong><small>从一个命令开始，沿着目录寻找文字。</small></span><span class="choice-action">ENTER ↗</span></span>
          </button>
          <button class="choice choice-web" data-open="web" aria-label="打开网页阅读模式">
            <span class="choice-number">02 &nbsp; / &nbsp; EXPLORE BY SIGHT</span>
            <canvas id="particle-title" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
            <span class="choice-bottom"><span><strong>Web</strong><small>穿过星空，安静地读一篇文章。</small></span><span class="choice-action">ENTER ↗</span></span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="gateway-footer"><span>技术与随笔 / TECH & NOTES</span><span>SCROLL LESS, READ MORE.</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="experience experience-terminal" id="terminal-view" hidden aria-label="网页终端">
        <header class="site-header terminal-header"><button class="wordmark" data-home aria-label="返回首页"><img class="avatar" src="/avatar.jpg" alt="" /><span> / TERMINAL</span></button><div><button class="header-link" id="terminal-theme" aria-label="切换终端昼夜主题">☀ DAY</button><button class="header-link" data-switch="web">WEB VIEW ↗</button></div></header>
        <div class="terminal-scene"><div class="terminal-paper" id="terminal-paper"><div class="paper-top"><span class="paper-seal">VECT / FIELD NOTES</span><span>READ ONLY · VOL. 001</span></div><div class="terminal-history" id="terminal-history" aria-live="polite"><div class="terminal-welcome"><span class="welcome-eyebrow">A QUIET CORNER OF THE INTERNET</span><h1>欢迎来到 Vect 的文字目录。</h1><p>输入 <code>help</code> 查看命令，或先试试 <code>ls</code>。所有内容均为只读。</p></div></div><form id="terminal-form" autocomplete="off"><label for="terminal-input" id="terminal-prompt">Vect:~$</label><input id="terminal-input" type="text" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" aria-label="输入只读命令" autofocus /><button type="submit" aria-label="执行命令">↵</button></form><div class="paper-bottom"><span>ROOT / VECT</span><span id="terminal-status">READY FOR INPUT</span></div></div><div class="terminal-side-note">WORDS, FILED LIKE THOUGHTS.<br/>思绪有迹可循。</div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="experience experience-web" id="web-view" hidden aria-label="网页浏览">
        <header class="site-header web-header"><button class="wordmark" data-home aria-label="返回首页"><img class="avatar" src="/avatar.jpg" alt="" /><span> / JOURNAL</span></button><nav aria-label="主要导航"><button class="header-link" data-web-page="about">ABOUT</button><button class="header-link active" data-web-page="blog">BLOG</button><button class="header-link" data-switch="terminal">TERMINAL ↗</button></nav></header>
        <div class="web-content" id="blog-list"><div class="web-intro"><span class="eyebrow">THE JOURNAL / 文字宇宙</span><h1>把想法，<br/><em>留在这里。</em></h1><p>一些关于技术的追问，也有一些生活里的细小回声。</p></div><div class="list-heading"><span>ALL ENTRIES <b id="post-count">02</b></span><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="文章分类"><button class="active" data-filter="all">全部</button><button data-filter="tech">⌘ 技术</button><button data-filter="notes">✦ 随笔</button></div></div><div class="post-list">{rendered.map(({ post }) => <button class="post-row" data-post={post.id} data-category={post.data.category}><span class="post-date">{post.data.date.toLocaleDateString('zh-CN', { year: 'numeric', month: '2-digit', day: '2-digit' })}</span><span class="post-main"><span class="post-category">{post.data.category === 'tech' ? 'TECH / 技术' : 'NOTES / 随笔'}</span><strong>{post.data.title}</strong><small>{post.data.description}</small></span><span class="post-arrow">↗</span></button>)}</div><p class="empty-state" id="empty-state" hidden>这里暂时没有文章。<br/><span>下一篇，正在路上。</span></p><div class="web-outro">慢慢读。<span>Take your time.</span></div></div>
        <div class="web-content about-page" id="about-page" hidden><button class="back-link" data-web-page="blog">← 返回文章</button><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT / 关于我</span><h1>你好，<em>我是 Vect。</em></h1><div class="about-copy"><p>这里是一片尚在生长的个人空间。</p><p>我在学习 Go、后端开发，也在尝试把技术笔记整理成真正值得分享的文章。</p><p>这个博客有两种入口。你可以像浏览普通网站一样阅读，也可以在网页终端里沿着目录找到文章。</p><p class="draft-note">这是一份原型占位介绍，正式内容由你审阅后替换。</p></div></div>
        <div class="web-content article-page" id="article-page" hidden><button class="back-link" data-web-page="blog">← 返回文章</button><div id="article-container"></div></div>
        <footer class="web-footer"><span>© VECT — MADE FOR READING</span><span id="weather-label">✦ 星空 / 默认场景</span></footer>
      </section>
    </main>

    <div id="post-templates" hidden>{rendered.map(({ post, Content }) => <article class="prose" data-template={post.id}><Content /></article>)}</div>
    <script id="catalog" type="application/json" set:html={JSON.stringify(catalog)}></script>
    <script src="../scripts/app.ts"></script>
  </body>
</html>
